WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.369
Paving over any abelian subalgebra.

2
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:07.716
Cut an operator into blocks with projections from a maximal abelian subalgebra.

3
00:00:07.866 --> 00:00:11.235
On each block it is nearly diagonal. How few blocks suffice?

4
00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:14.932
Claimed: about one over epsilon squared blocks suffice.

5
00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:17.232
No Lean check yet.
